{
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "title": "1. Overview",
      "text": "%md\n## 1. Overview\n\n### Checkpoint policy (#85)\n\nCheckpoint ID `streaming-online-retail-cdc-v1` is owned by **Streaming Data Engineering** and classified as a **durable stream**. While active or uncertain it is never age-deleted. Eligibility requires reviewed retirement, a stopped or retired terminal lease, approved recovery, and a 30-day quarantine. CDC recovery is not assumed safe: source retention, event ordering, and sink corrections must be reviewed. Manual exact-leaf retention is available through issue #86's reviewed plan/prepare/apply protocol. Automated and scheduled deletion remain disabled pending stronger MinIO cross-process CAS and conditional delete proof.",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "2. Setup",
      "text": "%md\n## 2. Setup",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "2. Setup (code)",
      "text": "%spark\nimport spark.implicits._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.types._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "2. Checkpoint lease (code)",
      "text": "%spark\nimport java.net.{HttpURLConnection, URL}\nimport java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets\nimport java.util.UUID\nimport java.util.concurrent.{Executors, TimeUnit}\nimport java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicReference\nimport com.fasterxml.jackson.core.JsonParser\nimport com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.{JsonNode, ObjectMapper}\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.streaming.StreamingQuery\nimport scala.collection.JavaConverters._\n\nfinal class CheckpointLease(\n  checkpointId: String,\n  prefix: String,\n  workload: String,\n  terminalState: String,\n  generation: Map[String, String]\n) extends AutoCloseable {\n  private val origin = \"http://checkpoint-retention:8080\"\n  private val token = Option(System.getenv(\"CHECKPOINT_RETENTION_LEASE_TOKEN\"))\n    .filter(value => value.nonEmpty && value.getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8).length <= 256)\n    .getOrElse(throw new IllegalStateException(\"checkpoint lease configuration invalid\"))\n  private val leaseMapper = new ObjectMapper().enable(JsonParser.Feature.STRICT_DUPLICATE_DETECTION)\n  private val sessionId = UUID.randomUUID().toString\n  @volatile private var query: StreamingQuery = _\n  private val heartbeatFailure = new AtomicReference[Throwable]()\n  private val executor = Executors.newSingleThreadScheduledExecutor { runnable =>\n    val thread = new Thread(runnable, \"checkpoint-lease\")\n    thread.setDaemon(true)\n    thread\n  }\n\n  private def post(path: String, value: JsonNode): JsonNode = {\n    val body = leaseMapper.writeValueAsBytes(value)\n    require(body.nonEmpty && body.length <= 65536, \"checkpoint lease request invalid\")\n    val connection = new URL(origin + path).openConnection().asInstanceOf[HttpURLConnection]\n    connection.setInstanceFollowRedirects(false)\n    connection.setRequestMethod(\"POST\")\n    connection.setRequestProperty(\"Authorization\", \"Bearer \" + token)\n    connection.setRequestProperty(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")\n    connection.setFixedLengthStreamingMode(body.length)\n    connection.setConnectTimeout(5000)\n    connection.setReadTimeout(10000)\n    connection.setDoOutput(true)\n    try {\n      val output = connection.getOutputStream\n      try output.write(body) finally output.close()\n      require(connection.getResponseCode == 200, \"checkpoint lease request failed\")\n      val input = connection.getInputStream\n      val responseBytes = try input.readNBytes(65537) finally input.close()\n      require(responseBytes.length <= 65536, \"checkpoint lease response invalid\")\n      leaseMapper.readTree(responseBytes)\n    } finally connection.disconnect()\n  }\n\n  private val epoch = {\n    val request = leaseMapper.createObjectNode()\n    request.put(\"checkpoint_id\", checkpointId)\n    request.put(\"owner_id\", \"zeppelin-notebook\")\n    request.put(\"prefix\", prefix)\n    request.put(\"session_id\", sessionId)\n    request.put(\"workload\", workload)\n    val value = post(\"/v1/leases/acquire\", request).path(\"epoch\").asText(\"\")\n    require(value.matches(\"[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[1-5][0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}\"), \"checkpoint lease response invalid\")\n    value\n  }\n\n  private def heartbeat(): Unit = {\n    val request = leaseMapper.createObjectNode()\n    request.put(\"checkpoint_id\", checkpointId)\n    request.put(\"epoch\", epoch)\n    request.put(\"prefix\", prefix)\n    post(\"/v1/leases/heartbeat\", request)\n  }\n\n  def bindQuery(value: StreamingQuery): Unit = {\n    require(value != null && query == null, \"checkpoint query invalid\")\n    query = value\n    executor.scheduleAtFixedRate(\n      new Runnable {\n        override def run(): Unit = {\n          try heartbeat()\n          catch {\n            case _: Throwable =>\n              heartbeatFailure.compareAndSet(null, new IllegalStateException(\"checkpoint heartbeat failed\"))\n              try if (query != null && query.isActive) query.stop() catch { case _: Throwable => () }\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      60,\n      60,\n      TimeUnit.SECONDS\n    )\n  }\n\n  override def close(): Unit = {\n    executor.shutdownNow()\n    if (query != null && query.isActive) query.stop()\n    var finalHeartbeatFailure: Throwable = null\n    try heartbeat() catch {\n      case _: Throwable => finalHeartbeatFailure = new IllegalStateException(\"checkpoint heartbeat failed\")\n    }\n    val request = leaseMapper.createObjectNode()\n    request.put(\"checkpoint_id\", checkpointId)\n    request.put(\"epoch\", epoch)\n    request.put(\"prefix\", prefix)\n    request.put(\"state\", terminalState)\n    val evidence = request.putObject(\"evidence\")\n    val generationNode = evidence.putObject(\"generation\")\n    generation.toSeq.sortBy(_._1).foreach { case (key, value) => generationNode.put(key, value) }\n    post(\"/v1/leases/terminal\", request)\n    if (finalHeartbeatFailure != null) throw finalHeartbeatFailure\n    Option(heartbeatFailure.get()).foreach(throw _)\n  }\n}",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "3. Read",
      "text": "%md\n## 3. Read",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "3. Read (code)",
      "text": "%spark\nspark.sql(\"CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS lakehouse.silver.online_retail_cdc (invoice string, stock_code string, quantity int, price double) USING iceberg\")\nval schema = new StructType().add(\"invoice\", StringType).add(\"stock_code\", StringType).add(\"quantity\", IntegerType).add(\"price\", DoubleType)\nval raw = spark.readStream.format(\"kafka\").option(\"kafka.bootstrap.servers\", \"redpanda:9092\").option(\"subscribe\", \"online_retail_cdc\").option(\"startingOffsets\", \"earliest\").load()\nval cdc = raw.select(from_json($\"value\".cast(\"string\"), schema).as(\"c\")).select(\"c.*\")",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "4. Transform",
      "text": "%md\n## 4. Transform",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "4. Transform (code)",
      "text": "%spark\nval parsed = cdc\n// CDC rows are upserted per micro-batch in the Write step",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "5. Write",
      "text": "%md\n## 5. Write",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "5. Write (code)",
      "text": "%spark\nval lease = new CheckpointLease(\n  checkpointId = \"streaming-online-retail-cdc-v1\",\n  prefix = \"online_retail_cdc/\",\n  workload = \"cdc_streaming-online_retail-spark-iceberg\",\n  terminalState = \"stopped\",\n  generation = Map.empty[String, String]\n)\nvar leasePrimary: Throwable = null\ntry {\n  val query = parsed.writeStream.foreachBatch { (batchDF: DataFrame, batchId: Long) =>\n    batchDF.createOrReplaceTempView(\"cdc_batch\")\n    batchDF.sparkSession.sql(\"MERGE INTO lakehouse.silver.online_retail_cdc t USING cdc_batch s ON t.invoice = s.invoice AND t.stock_code = s.stock_code WHEN MATCHED THEN UPDATE SET t.quantity = s.quantity, t.price = s.price WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN INSERT *\")\n  }.option(\"checkpointLocation\", \"s3a://checkpoints/online_retail_cdc\").start()\n  lease.bindQuery(query)\n  query.awaitTermination()\n} catch {\n  case error: Throwable =>\n    leasePrimary = error\n    throw error\n} finally {\n  try lease.close()\n  catch {\n    case _: Throwable if leasePrimary != null =>\n      leasePrimary.addSuppressed(new IllegalStateException(\"checkpoint lease cleanup failed\"))\n    case cleanup: Throwable => throw cleanup\n  }\n}",
      "config": {},
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "6. Verify",
      "text": "%md\n## 6. Verify",
      "config": {},
